   "plans": [
    "Play d4, Nf3, Be2 and O-O, then Be3. You do not need to chase the queen with pawns.",
    "When Black plays ...cxd4, take back with the c-pawn. That frees c3 for your knight, and Nc3 comes with tempo on the d5 queen.",
    "Against the ...Bg4 pin, Be2 and castling are enough. h3 later asks the bishop what it wants."
   ],
   "strategic": [
